[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おい、樹里！\r\n『W.I.N.G.』の三次審査、通過したぞ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "011",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "よしっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やったな、樹里ならやれると思ってたぞ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ほ、ホントか？\r\n実は、アタシけっこー不安だったんだよな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おいおい、もっと自信を持っていいぞ\r\n樹里は精一杯やれることやってるからな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……アタシのこと、そうやって見てくれているのは\r\n悪い気しね－けどさ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "でもよ、『W.I.N.G.』が近付いてくると\r\nそのデカさもわかってくるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そう簡単には届かね－ステ－ジだなって\r\nけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けど？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "だんだん 『W.I.N.G.』が近くに見えてきた気がするぜ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな\r\nこの勢いで一緒に最終審査を突破しよう！",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "お、おう\r\nこれからもよろしく頼むな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……アタシがここまで来れたのは、\r\nアンタのそれがあるからだな",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それって？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アンタが一緒に頑張ってくれたから、\r\nここまで来れた……ってことだよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお……\r\n樹里にそう言ってもらえるなんて、感慨深いな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "はあ？\r\nそんなに感動することかよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そりゃ感動するさ\r\n樹里は変わったな、と思ってな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そう、か？　あんま自覚はね－けど\r\nもしかしたら……ホントに少しずつ変わってきてるのかもな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今の方が活き活きしてていいぞ\r\nこれからもっと変わっていける",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、本番に向けてスケジュ－ルを組んでいくぞ\r\n今まで以上に大変になるぞ？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7011001050120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ああ、いくらでも付き合ってやるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701100105/7011001050120"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]